		 * get_unmapped_area() may align even MAP_FIXED moves, we simply
		 * attempt to move such that the gaps between source VMAs remain
		 * consistent in destination VMAs, e.g.:
		 *
		 *           X        Y                       X        Y
		 *         <--->     <->                    <--->     <->
		 * |-------|   |-----| |-----|      |-------|   |-----| |-----|
		 * |   A   |   |  B  | |  C  | ---> |   A'  |   |  B' | |  C' |
		 * |-------|   |-----| |-----|      |-------|   |-----| |-----|
